 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505349,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If  possible, add the following irrational numbers without using a calculator. If this is not possible, state why.\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"4.1\\pi  + 3.2\\pi\">4.1\\pi  + 3.2\\pi</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"4.1\\pi  + 3.2\\pi \"></span></p>\n<p>Because they have the same irrational part, you can add without using a calculator.</p>\n<p>The formula uses the distributive property: <span data-math=\"\\left( {a \\times x} \\right) \\pm \\left( {b \\times x} \\right) = \\left( {a \\pm b} \\right) \\times x\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {4.1 + 3.2} \\right) \\times \\pi \"></span> Add.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"7.3\\pi \"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"7.3\\pi\">7.3\\pi</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
